    <section>
      <para>The scatter plot shows data on weight in pounds (x) and fuel efficiency in miles per gallon (y) for 13 cars. </para>
      <para>
        <figure>
          <media alt="points (2500, 28), (3259,23), (3500,25), (3559,22), (3550,18), (3700,20), (4000,20), (4000,18), (4400,16), (4500,16), (4750, 14), (5250, 12), (5700,15)">
